<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sets commercial dlr buy/sell tender.</title>
<headline>Brazil sets commercial dlr buy/sell tender.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's central bank announced an auction in the commercial foreign exchange market requiring buy and sell offers from financial institutions, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo Newsroom 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
